# Build output
dist/
*.tgz

# ReScript artifacts: in-source .bs.js output and the build cache under lib/.
# The monorepo root .gitignore covers lib/ and dist/ but NOT *.bs.js, so this file is
# what keeps 75+ generated modules out of the tree. The .gen.tsx declarations are
# generated too, but they ARE tracked — `check-generated` proves they reproduce from source.
*.bs.js
*.bs.js.map
.bsb.lock
lib/

node_modules/
.DS_Store
